OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTonight,
OL,6,Fmist and fog will develop under clear
OL,7,Fskies and light winds before turning
OL,8,Fcloudier from the north with patchy
OL,9,Frain to follow. Further south, mist
OL,10,Fand fog may linger into Sunday
OL,11,Fmorning. A chillier night than the
OL,12,Flast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FLow cloud and patchy rain make
OL,15,Fgradual progress southeastwards
OL,16,Fthrough the day. Turning dry with
OL,17,Fsunny spells once it clears.
OL,18,FTemperatures around average for the
OL,19,Ftime of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
